      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"39\" type=\"品\">39 入法界品</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"2\" type=\"品\">之二</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<milestone n=\"62\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c22\">0331c22</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c23\">0331c23</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c24\">0331c24</span><cb:juan n=\"062\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"062\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第六十二</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c25\">0331c25</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c26\">0331c26</span><byline>于闐國<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0331c01\"/>三藏實叉難陀<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0331c02\"/>奉　制譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c27\">0331c27</span><cb:div><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"3\" type=\"品\">之三</cb:mulu><head>入法界品第三十九之三</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c28\">0331c28</span><p>爾時，文殊師利菩薩勸諸比丘發阿耨多羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0331c29\">0331c29</span>三藐三菩提心已，漸次南行，經歷人間，至福\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a01\">0332a01</span>城東，住莊嚴幢娑羅林中往昔諸佛曾所止\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a02\">0332a02</span>住教化眾生大塔廟處，亦是世尊於往昔\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a03\">0332a03</span>時修菩薩行能捨無量難捨之處；是故，此林\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a04\">0332a04</span>名稱普聞無量佛剎，此處常為天、龍、夜叉、乾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a05\">0332a05</span>闥婆、阿脩羅、迦樓羅、緊那羅、摩睺羅伽、人與非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a06\">0332a06</span>人之所供養。</p><p>時，文殊師利與其眷屬到此處\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a07\">0332a07</span>已，即於其處說普照法界修多羅，百萬億那\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a08\">0332a08</span>由他修多羅以為眷屬。說此經時，於大海中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a09\">0332a09</span>有無量百千億諸龍而來其所；聞此法已，深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a10\">0332a10</span>厭龍趣，正求佛道，咸捨龍身，生天人中。一萬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a11\">0332a11</span>諸龍，於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提得不退轉；復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a12\">0332a12</span>有無量無數眾生，於三乘中各得調伏。</p><p>時，福\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a13\">0332a13</span>城人聞文殊師利童子在莊嚴幢娑羅林中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a14\">0332a14</span>大塔廟處，無量大眾從其城出，來詣其所。時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a15\">0332a15</span>有優婆塞，名曰：大智，與五百優婆塞眷屬俱，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a16\">0332a16</span>所謂：須達多優婆塞、婆須達多優婆塞、福德\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a17\">0332a17</span>光優婆塞、有名稱優婆塞、施名稱優婆塞、月\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a18\">0332a18</span>德優婆塞、善慧優婆塞、大慧優婆塞、賢護優\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a19\">0332a19</span>婆塞、賢勝優婆塞……如是等五百優婆塞俱，來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a20\">0332a20</span>詣文殊師利童子所，頂禮其足，右遶三匝，退\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a21\">0332a21</span>坐一面。復有五百優婆夷，所謂：大慧優婆夷、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a22\">0332a22</span>善光優婆夷、妙身優婆夷、可樂身優婆夷、賢\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a23\">0332a23</span>優婆夷、賢德優婆夷、賢光優婆夷、幢光優婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a24\">0332a24</span>夷、德光優婆夷、善目優婆夷……如是等五百優\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a25\">0332a25</span>婆夷，來詣文殊師利童子所，頂禮其足，右\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a26\">0332a26</span>遶三匝，退坐一面。復有五百童子，所謂：善財\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a27\">0332a27</span>童子、善行童子、善戒童子、善威儀童子、善勇\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a28\">0332a28</span>猛童子、善思童子、善慧童子、善覺童子、善眼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332a29\">0332a29</span>童子、善臂童子、善光童子……如是等五百童子，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b01\">0332b01</span>來詣文殊師利童子所，頂禮其足，右遶三匝，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b02\">0332b02</span>退坐一面。復有五百童女，所謂：善賢童女、大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b03\">0332b03</span>智居士女童女、賢稱童女、美顏童女、堅慧童\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b04\">0332b04</span>女、賢德童女、有德童女、梵授童女、德光童\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b05\">0332b05</span>女、善光童女……如是等五百童女，來詣文殊師\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b06\">0332b06</span>利童子所，頂禮其足，右遶三匝，退坐一面。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b07\">0332b07</span><p>爾時，文殊師利童子知福城人悉已來集，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b08\">0332b08</span>其心樂現自在身，威光赫奕蔽諸大眾；以自\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b09\">0332b09</span>在大慈令彼清涼，以自在大悲起說法心，以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b10\">0332b10</span>自在智慧知其心樂，以廣大辯才將為說法。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b11\">0332b11</span>復於是時，觀察善財以何因緣而有其名？知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b12\">0332b12</span>此童子初入胎時，於其宅內自然而出七寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b13\">0332b13</span>樓閣，其樓閣下有七伏藏，於其藏上，地自開\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b14\">0332b14</span>裂，生七寶<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332001\">芽＝牙【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332001\">芽【大】，牙【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0332001\"><p class=\"lg\">芽</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">牙</rdg></app>，所謂：金、銀、瑠璃、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332002\">玻黎＝頗梨【宋】【元】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332002\">玻瓈【大】＊，頗梨【宋】【元】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0332002\"><p class=\"lg\">玻瓈</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">頗梨</rdg></app>、真珠、硨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b15\">0332b15</span>磲、碼碯。善財童子處胎十月然後誕生，形體\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b16\">0332b16</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332003\">肢＝支【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332003\">肢【大】，支【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0332003\"><p class=\"lg\">肢</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">支</rdg></app>分端正具足；其七大藏，縱廣高下各滿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b17\">0332b17</span>七肘，從地<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332004\">涌＝踊【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332004\">涌【大】，踊【宮】</span><app n=\"0332004\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">踊</rdg></app>出，光明照<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332005\">耀＝曜【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332005\">耀【大】＊，曜【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0332005\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">曜</rdg></app>。復於宅中自然\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b18\">0332b18</span>而有五百寶器，種種諸物自然盈滿。所謂：金\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b19\">0332b19</span>剛器中盛一切香，於香器中盛種種衣，美玉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b20\">0332b20</span>器中盛滿種種上味飲食，摩尼器中盛滿種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b21\">0332b21</span>種殊異珍寶，金器盛銀，銀器盛金，金銀器中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b22\">0332b22</span>盛滿瑠璃及摩尼寶，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332002\"><p class=\"lg\">玻瓈</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">頗梨</rdg></app>器中盛滿硨磲，硨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b23\">0332b23</span>磲器中盛滿<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332002\"><p class=\"lg\">玻瓈</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">頗梨</rdg></app>，碼碯器中盛滿真珠，真珠\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b24\">0332b24</span>器中盛滿碼碯，火摩尼器中盛滿水摩尼，水\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b25\">0332b25</span>摩尼器中盛滿火摩尼……。如是等五百寶器，自\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b26\">0332b26</span>然出現。又雨眾寶及諸財物，一切庫藏悉令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b27\">0332b27</span>充滿。以此事故，父母親屬及善相師共呼此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b28\">0332b28</span>兒，名曰：善財。又知此童子，已曾供養過去諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332b29\">0332b29</span>佛，深種善根，信解廣大，常樂親近諸善知識，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c01\">0332c01</span>身、語、意業皆無過失，淨菩薩道，求一切智，成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c02\">0332c02</span>佛法器，其心清淨猶如虛空，迴向菩提無所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c03\">0332c03</span>障礙。</p><p>爾時，文殊師利菩薩如是觀察善財童\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c04\">0332c04</span>子已，安慰開<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332006\">諭＝喻【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332006\">諭【大】＊，喻【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0332006\"><p class=\"lg\">諭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">喻</rdg></app>，而為演說一切佛法。所謂：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c05\">0332c05</span>說一切佛積集法，說一切佛相續法，說一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c06\">0332c06</span>佛次第法，說一切佛眾會清淨法，說一切佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c07\">0332c07</span>法輪化導法，說一切佛色身相好法，說一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c08\">0332c08</span>佛法身成就法，說一切佛言辭辯才法，說一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c09\">0332c09</span>切佛光明照<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332005\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">曜</rdg></app>法，說一切佛平等無二法。爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c10\">0332c10</span>時，文殊師利童子為善財童子及諸大眾說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c11\">0332c11</span>此法已，慇懃勸<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332006\"><p class=\"lg\">諭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">喻</rdg></app>，增長勢力，令其歡喜，發\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c12\">0332c12</span>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心，又令憶念過去善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c13\">0332c13</span>根；作是事已，即於其處，復為眾生隨宜說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c14\">0332c14</span>法，然後而去。</p><p>爾時，善財童子從文殊師利所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c15\">0332c15</span>聞佛如是種種功德，一心勤求阿耨多羅三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c16\">0332c16</span>藐三菩提，隨文殊師利而說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c17\">0332c17</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「三有為城廓，<caesura/>憍慢為垣牆，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c18\">0332c18</span><p class=\"lg\">諸趣為門戶，<caesura/>愛水為池塹。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c19\">0332c19</span><p class=\"lg\">愚癡闇所覆，<caesura/>貪恚火熾然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c20\">0332c20</span><p class=\"lg\">魔王作君主，<caesura/>童蒙依止住。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c21\">0332c21</span><p class=\"lg\">貪愛為徽<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0332c2101\">纆【CB】【麗-CB】，纏【大】</span><app n=\"0332c2101\"><p class=\"lg\">纆<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0815a11</note><note type=\"cf2\">X04n0223_p0611a12</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">纏</rdg></app>，<caesura/>諂誑為轡勒，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c22\">0332c22</span><p class=\"lg\">疑惑蔽其眼，<caesura/>趣入諸邪道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c23\">0332c23</span><p class=\"lg\">慳嫉憍盈故，<caesura/>入於三惡處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c24\">0332c24</span><p class=\"lg\">或墮諸趣中，<caesura/>生老病死苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c25\">0332c25</span><p class=\"lg\">妙智清淨日，<caesura/>大悲圓滿輪，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c26\">0332c26</span><p class=\"lg\">能竭煩惱海，<caesura/>願賜少觀察！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c27\">0332c27</span><p class=\"lg\">妙智清淨月，<caesura/>大慈無垢輪，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c28\">0332c28</span><p class=\"lg\">一切悉施安，<caesura/>願垂照察我！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0332c29\">0332c29</span><p class=\"lg\">一切法界王，<caesura/>法寶為先導，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a01\">0333a01</span><p class=\"lg\">遊空無所礙，<caesura/>願垂教<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333a0101\">敕【CB】【麗-CB】，勅【大】</span><app n=\"0333a0101\"><p class=\"lg\">敕<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0815a15</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">勅</rdg></app>我！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a02\">0333a02</span><p class=\"lg\">福智大商主，<caesura/>勇猛求菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a03\">0333a03</span><p class=\"lg\">普利諸群生，<caesura/>願垂守護我！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a04\">0333a04</span><p class=\"lg\">身被忍辱甲，<caesura/>手提智慧劍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a05\">0333a05</span><p class=\"lg\">自在降魔軍，<caesura/>願垂拔濟我！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a06\">0333a06</span><p class=\"lg\">住法須彌頂，<caesura/>定女常恭侍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a07\">0333a07</span><p class=\"lg\">滅惑阿脩羅，<caesura/>帝釋願觀我！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a08\">0333a08</span><p class=\"lg\">三有凡愚宅，<caesura/>惑業地趣因；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a09\">0333a09</span><p class=\"lg\">仁者悉調伏，<caesura/>如燈示我道！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a10\">0333a10</span><p class=\"lg\">捨離諸惡趣，<caesura/>清淨諸善道；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a11\">0333a11</span><p class=\"lg\">超諸世間者，<caesura/>示我解脫門！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a12\">0333a12</span><p class=\"lg\">世間顛倒執，<caesura/>常樂我淨想；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a13\">0333a13</span><p class=\"lg\">智眼悉能離，<caesura/>開我解脫門！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a14\">0333a14</span><p class=\"lg\">善知邪正道，<caesura/>分別心無怯；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a15\">0333a15</span><p class=\"lg\">一切決了人，<caesura/>示我菩提路！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a16\">0333a16</span><p class=\"lg\">住佛正見地，<caesura/>長佛功德樹，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a17\">0333a17</span><p class=\"lg\">雨佛妙法華，<caesura/>示我菩提道！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a18\">0333a18</span><p class=\"lg\">去來現在佛，<caesura/>處處悉周遍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a19\">0333a19</span><p class=\"lg\">如日出世間，<caesura/>為我說其道！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a20\">0333a20</span><p class=\"lg\">善知一切業，<caesura/>深達諸乘行；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a21\">0333a21</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧決定人，<caesura/>示我摩訶衍！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a22\">0333a22</span><p class=\"lg\">願輪大悲轂，<caesura/>信軸堅忍<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333001\">鎋＝轄【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333001\">鎋【大】，轄【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0333001\"><p class=\"lg\">鎋</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">轄</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a23\">0333a23</span><p class=\"lg\">功德寶莊校，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a24\">0333a24</span><p class=\"lg\">總持廣大箱，<caesura/>慈愍莊嚴蓋，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a25\">0333a25</span><p class=\"lg\">辯才鈴<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333002\">震＝振【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333002\">震【大】＊，振【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0333002\"><p class=\"lg\">震</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">振</rdg></app>響，<caesura/>使我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a26\">0333a26</span><p class=\"lg\">梵行為茵蓐，<caesura/>三昧為采女，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a27\">0333a27</span><p class=\"lg\">法鼓<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0333002\"><p class=\"lg\">震</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">振</rdg></app>妙音，<caesura/>願與我此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a28\">0333a28</span><p class=\"lg\">四攝無盡藏，<caesura/>功德莊嚴寶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333a29\">0333a29</span><p class=\"lg\">慚愧為羈鞅，<caesura/>願與我此乘！</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b01\">0333b01</span><p class=\"lg\">常轉布施輪，<caesura/>恒塗淨戒香，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b02\">0333b02</span><p class=\"lg\">忍辱牢莊嚴，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b03\">0333b03</span><p class=\"lg\">禪定三昧<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333003\">箱＝廂【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333003\">箱【大】，廂【宋】</span><app n=\"0333003\"><p class=\"lg\">箱</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\">廂</rdg></app>，<caesura/>智慧方便軛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b04\">0333b04</span><p class=\"lg\">調伏不退轉，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b05\">0333b05</span><p class=\"lg\">大願清淨輪，<caesura/>總持堅固力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b06\">0333b06</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧所成就，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b07\">0333b07</span><p class=\"lg\">普行為周校，<caesura/>悲心作徐轉，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b08\">0333b08</span><p class=\"lg\">所向皆無怯，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b09\">0333b09</span><p class=\"lg\">堅固如金剛，<caesura/>善巧如幻化，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b10\">0333b10</span><p class=\"lg\">一切無障礙，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b11\">0333b11</span><p class=\"lg\">廣大極清淨，<caesura/>普與眾生樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b12\">0333b12</span><p class=\"lg\">虛空法界等，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b13\">0333b13</span><p class=\"lg\">淨諸業惑輪，<caesura/>斷諸流轉苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b14\">0333b14</span><p class=\"lg\">摧魔及外道，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b15\">0333b15</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧滿十方，<caesura/>莊嚴遍法界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b16\">0333b16</span><p class=\"lg\">普洽眾生<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333004\">類＝願【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333004\">類【大】，願【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0333004\"><p class=\"lg\">類</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">願</rdg></app>，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b17\">0333b17</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨如虛空，<caesura/>愛見悉除滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b18\">0333b18</span><p class=\"lg\">利益一切眾，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b19\">0333b19</span><p class=\"lg\">願力速疾行，<caesura/>定心安隱住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b20\">0333b20</span><p class=\"lg\">普運諸含識，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b21\">0333b21</span><p class=\"lg\">如地不傾動，<caesura/>如水普饒益，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b22\">0333b22</span><p class=\"lg\">如是運眾生，<caesura/>令我載此乘！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b23\">0333b23</span><p class=\"lg\">四攝圓滿輪，<caesura/>總持清淨光；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b24\">0333b24</span><p class=\"lg\">如是智慧日，<caesura/>願示我令見！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b25\">0333b25</span><p class=\"lg\">已入法王<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333005\">城＝位【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333005\">城【大】，位【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0333005\"><p class=\"lg\">城</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">位</rdg></app>，<caesura/>已著智王冠，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b26\">0333b26</span><p class=\"lg\">已繫妙法繒，<caesura/>願<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333006\">能＝垂【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333006\">能【大】，垂【宮】</span><app n=\"0333006\"><p class=\"lg\">能</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">垂</rdg></app>慈顧我！」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b27\">0333b27</span><p>爾時，文殊師利菩薩如象王迴，觀善財童子，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b28\">0333b28</span>作如是言：「善哉善哉！善男子！汝已發阿耨多\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333b29\">0333b29</span>羅三藐三菩提心，復欲親近諸善知識，問菩\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c01\">0333c01</span>薩行，修菩薩道。善男子！親近供養諸善知識，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c02\">0333c02</span>是具一切智最初因緣，是故於此勿生疲厭。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c03\">0333c03</span><p>善財白言：「唯願聖者廣為我說，菩薩應云何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c04\">0333c04</span>學菩薩行？應云何修菩薩行？應云何趣菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c05\">0333c05</span>行？應云何行菩薩行？應云何淨菩薩行？應云\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c06\">0333c06</span>何入菩薩行？應云何成就菩薩行？應云何隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c07\">0333c07</span>順菩薩行？應云何憶念菩薩行？應云何增廣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c08\">0333c08</span>菩薩行？應云何令普賢行速得圓滿？」</p><p>爾時，文\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c09\">0333c09</span>殊師利菩薩為善財童子而說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c10\">0333c10</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333007\">哉＝財【元】，明註曰哉作財</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333007\">哉【大】，財【元】，明註曰哉作財</span><app n=\"0333007\"><p class=\"lg\">哉</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">財</rdg></app><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0333007\">明註曰哉作財</span>功德藏，<caesura/>能來至我所，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c11\">0333c11</span><p class=\"lg\">發起大悲心，<caesura/>勤求無上覺。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c12\">0333c12</span><p class=\"lg\">已發廣大願，<caesura/>除滅眾生苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c13\">0333c13</span><p class=\"lg\">普為諸世間，<caesura/>修行菩薩行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c14\">0333c14</span><p class=\"lg\">若有諸菩薩，<caesura/>不厭生死苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c15\">0333c15</span><p class=\"lg\">則具普賢道，<caesura/>一切無能壞。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c16\">0333c16</span><p class=\"lg\">福光福威力，<caesura/>福處福淨海；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c17\">0333c17</span><p class=\"lg\">汝為諸眾生，<caesura/>願修普賢行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c18\">0333c18</span><p class=\"lg\">汝見無邊際，<caesura/>十方一切佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c19\">0333c19</span><p class=\"lg\">皆悉聽聞法，<caesura/>受持不忘失。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c20\">0333c20</span><p class=\"lg\">汝於十方界，<caesura/>普見無量佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c21\">0333c21</span><p class=\"lg\">成就諸願海，<caesura/>具足菩薩行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c22\">0333c22</span><p class=\"lg\">若入方便海，<caesura/>安住佛菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c23\">0333c23</span><p class=\"lg\">能隨導師學，<caesura/>當成一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c24\">0333c24</span><p class=\"lg\">汝遍一切剎，<caesura/>微塵等諸劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c25\">0333c25</span><p class=\"lg\">修行普賢行，<caesura/>成就菩提道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c26\">0333c26</span><p class=\"lg\">汝於無量剎，<caesura/>無邊諸劫海，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c27\">0333c27</span><p class=\"lg\">修行普賢行，<caesura/>成滿諸大願。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c28\">0333c28</span><p class=\"lg\">此無量眾生，<caesura/>聞汝願歡喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0333c29\">0333c29</span><p class=\"lg\">皆發菩提意，<caesura/>願學普賢乘。」</p></lg>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a01\">0334a01</span><p>爾時，文殊師利菩薩說此頌已，告善財童子\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a02\">0334a02</span>言：</p><p>「善哉善哉！善男子！汝已發阿耨多羅三藐\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a03\">0334a03</span>三菩提心，求菩薩行。善男子！若有眾生能發\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a04\">0334a04</span>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心，是事為難；能發心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a05\">0334a05</span>已，求菩薩行，倍更為難。</p><p>「善男子！若欲成就一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a06\">0334a06</span>切智智，應決定求真善知識。善男子！求善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a07\">0334a07</span>知識勿生疲懈，見善知識勿生厭足，於善知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a08\">0334a08</span>識所有教誨皆應隨順，於善知識善巧方便\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a09\">0334a09</span>勿見過失。</p><p>「善男子！於此南方有一國土，名為：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a10\">0334a10</span>勝樂；其國有山，名曰：妙峯；於彼山中，有一比\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a11\">0334a11</span>丘，名曰：德雲。汝可往問：菩薩云何學菩薩行？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a12\">0334a12</span>菩薩云何修菩薩行？乃至菩薩云何於普賢\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a13\">0334a13</span>行<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0334a1301\">疾【CB】【麗-CB】【磧-CB】，疲【大】</span><app n=\"0334a1301\"><p class=\"lg\">疾<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0816a04</note><note type=\"cf2\">Q08_p0164b02</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">疲</rdg></app>得圓滿？德雲比丘當為汝說。」</p><p>爾時，善財\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a14\">0334a14</span>童子聞是語已，歡喜踊躍，頭頂禮足，遶無數\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a15\">0334a15</span>匝，慇懃瞻仰，悲泣流淚。</p><p>辭退南行，向勝樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a16\">0334a16</span>國，登妙峯山，於其山上東、西、南、北、四維、上、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a17\">0334a17</span>下觀察求覓，渴仰欲見德雲比丘。經<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0334001\">于＝於【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0334001\">于【大】，於【明】</span><app n=\"0334001\"><p class=\"lg\">于</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">於</rdg></app>七\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a18\">0334a18</span>日，見彼比丘在別山上徐步經行。見已往詣，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a19\">0334a19</span>頂禮其足，右遶三匝，於前而住，作如是言：「聖\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a20\">0334a20</span>者！我已先發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心，而未知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a21\">0334a21</span>菩薩云何學菩薩行？云何修菩薩行？乃至應\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a22\">0334a22</span>云何於普賢行疾得圓滿？我聞聖者善能誘\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a23\">0334a23</span>誨，唯願垂慈，為我宣說：云何菩薩而得成就\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a24\">0334a24</span>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提？」</p><p>時，德雲比丘告善財\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a25\">0334a25</span>言：</p><p>「善哉善哉！善男子！汝已能發阿耨多羅三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a26\">0334a26</span>藐三菩提心，復能請問諸菩薩行。如是之事，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a27\">0334a27</span>難中之難。所謂：求菩薩行，求菩薩境界，求菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a28\">0334a28</span>薩出離道，求菩薩清淨道，求菩薩清淨廣大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334a29\">0334a29</span>心，求菩薩成就神通，求菩薩示現解脫門，求\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b01\">0334b01</span>菩薩示現世間所作業，求菩薩隨順眾生心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b02\">0334b02</span>求菩薩生死涅槃門，求菩薩觀察有為、無為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b03\">0334b03</span>心無所著。</p><p>「善男子！我得自在決定解力，信眼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b04\">0334b04</span>清淨，智光照曜，普觀境界，離一切障，善巧觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b05\">0334b05</span>察，普眼明徹，具清淨行，往詣十方一切國土，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b06\">0334b06</span>恭敬供養一切諸佛，常念一切諸佛如來，總\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b07\">0334b07</span>持一切諸佛正法，常見一切十方諸佛。所謂：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b08\">0334b08</span>見於東方一佛、二佛、十佛、百佛、千佛、百千佛、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b09\">0334b09</span>億佛、百億佛、千億佛、百千億佛、那由他億佛、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b10\">0334b10</span>百那由他億佛、千那由他億佛、百千那由他\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b11\">0334b11</span>億佛，乃至見無數、無量、無邊、無等、不可數、不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b12\">0334b12</span>可稱、不可思、不可量、不可說、不可說不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b13\">0334b13</span>說佛，乃至見閻浮提微塵數佛、四天下微塵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b14\">0334b14</span>數佛、千世界微塵數佛、二千世界微塵數佛、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b15\">0334b15</span>三千世界微塵數佛、佛剎微塵數佛，乃至不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b16\">0334b16</span>可說不可說佛剎微塵數佛；如東方，南、西、北\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b17\">0334b17</span>方，四維、上、下，亦復如是。一一方中所有諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b18\">0334b18</span>佛，種種色相、種種形貌、種種神通、種種遊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b19\">0334b19</span>戲、種種眾會莊嚴道場、種種光明無邊照\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b20\">0334b20</span><app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332005\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">曜</rdg></app>、種種國土、種種壽命，隨諸眾生種種心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b21\">0334b21</span>樂，示現種種成正覺門，於大眾中而師子吼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b22\">0334b22</span><p>「善男子！我唯得此憶念一切諸佛境界智慧光\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b23\">0334b23</span>明普見法門，豈能了知諸大菩薩無邊智慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b24\">0334b24</span>清淨行門？所謂：智光普照念佛門，常見一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b25\">0334b25</span>諸佛國土種種宮殿悉嚴淨故；令一切眾生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b26\">0334b26</span>念佛門，隨諸眾生心之所樂，皆令見佛得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b27\">0334b27</span>清淨故；令安住力念佛門，令入如來十力中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b28\">0334b28</span>故；令安住法念佛門，見無量佛，聽聞法故；照\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334b29\">0334b29</span><app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332005\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">曜</rdg></app>諸方念佛門，悉見一切諸世界中等無\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c01\">0334c01</span>差別諸佛海故；入不可見處念佛門，悉見一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c02\">0334c02</span>切微細境中諸佛自在神通事故；住於諸劫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c03\">0334c03</span>念佛門，一切劫中常見如來諸所施為無暫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c04\">0334c04</span>捨故；住一切時念佛門，於一切時常見如來，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c05\">0334c05</span>親近同住不捨離故；住一切剎念佛門，一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c06\">0334c06</span>國土咸見佛身超過一切無與等故；住一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c07\">0334c07</span>世念佛門，隨於自心之所欲樂普見三世諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c08\">0334c08</span>如來故；住一切境念佛門，普於一切諸境界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c09\">0334c09</span>中見諸如來次第現故；住寂滅念佛門，於一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c10\">0334c10</span>念中見一切剎一切諸佛示涅槃故；住遠離\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c11\">0334c11</span>念佛門，於一<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0334002\">日＝念【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0334002\">日【大】，念【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0334002\"><p class=\"lg\">日</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】 【宮】\">念</rdg></app>中見一切佛從其所住而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c12\">0334c12</span>出去故；住廣大念佛門，心常觀察一一佛身\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c13\">0334c13</span>充遍一切諸法界故；住微細念佛門，於一毛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c14\">0334c14</span>端有不可說如來出現，悉至其所而承事故；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c15\">0334c15</span>住莊嚴念佛門，於一念中見一切剎皆有諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c16\">0334c16</span>佛成等正覺現神變故；住能事念佛門，見一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c17\">0334c17</span>切佛出現世間放智慧光轉法輪故；住自在\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c18\">0334c18</span>心念佛門，知隨自心所有欲樂，一切諸佛現\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c19\">0334c19</span>其像故；住自業念佛門，知隨眾生所積集業，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c20\">0334c20</span>現其影像令覺悟故；住神變念佛門，見佛所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c21\">0334c21</span>坐廣大蓮華周遍法界而開敷故；住虛空念\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c22\">0334c22</span>佛門，觀察如來所有身雲莊嚴法界、虛空界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c23\">0334c23</span>故。而我云何能知能說彼功德行？</p><p>「善男子！南\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c24\">0334c24</span>方有國，名曰：海門；彼有比丘，名為：海雲。汝往\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c25\">0334c25</span>彼問：菩薩云何學菩薩行、修菩薩道？海雲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c26\">0334c26</span>比丘能分別說發起廣大善根因緣。善男子！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c27\">0334c27</span>海雲比丘當令汝入廣大助道位，當令汝生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c28\">0334c28</span>廣大善根力，當為汝說發菩提心因，當令汝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0334c29\">0334c29</span>生廣大乘光明，當令汝修廣大波羅蜜，當令\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a01\">0335a01</span>汝入廣大諸行海，當令汝滿廣大誓願輪，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a02\">0335a02</span>令汝淨廣大莊嚴門，當令汝生廣大慈悲力。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a03\">0335a03</span><p>時，善財童子禮德雲比丘足，右遶觀察，辭退\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a04\">0335a04</span>而去。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a05\">0335a05</span><p>爾時，善財童子一心思惟善知識教，正念觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a06\">0335a06</span>察智慧光明門，正念觀察菩薩解脫門，正念\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a07\">0335a07</span>觀察菩薩三昧門，正念觀察菩薩大海門，正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a08\">0335a08</span>念觀察諸佛現前門，正念觀察諸佛方所門，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a09\">0335a09</span>正念觀察諸佛軌則門，正念觀察諸佛等虛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a10\">0335a10</span>空界門，正念觀察諸佛出現次第門，正念觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a11\">0335a11</span>察諸佛所入方便門。</p><p>漸次南行，至海門國，向\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a12\">0335a12</span>海雲比丘所頂禮其足，右遶畢<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335001\">〔已〕－【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335001\">已【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0335001\"><p class=\"lg\">已</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>，於前合\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a13\">0335a13</span>掌，作如是言：「聖者！我已先發阿耨多羅三藐\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a14\">0335a14</span>三菩提心，欲入一切無上智海，而未知菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a15\">0335a15</span>云何能捨世俗家，生如來家？云何能度生死\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a16\">0335a16</span>海，入佛智海？云何能離凡夫地，入如來地？云\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a17\">0335a17</span>何能斷生死流，入菩薩行流？云何能破生死\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a18\">0335a18</span>輪，成菩薩願輪？云何能滅魔境界，顯佛境界？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a19\">0335a19</span>云何能竭愛欲海，長大悲海？云何能閉眾難\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a20\">0335a20</span>惡趣門，開諸<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335002\">天＝大【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335002\">天【大】，大【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0335002\"><p class=\"lg\">天</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">大</rdg></app>涅槃門？云何能出三界城，入\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a21\">0335a21</span>一切智城？云何能棄捨一切玩好之物，悉以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a22\">0335a22</span>饒益一切眾生？」</p><p>時，海雲比丘告善財言：「善男\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a23\">0335a23</span>子！汝已發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心耶？」</p><p>善財\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a24\">0335a24</span>言：「唯！我已先發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心。」</p><p>海\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a25\">0335a25</span>雲言：</p><p>「善男子！若諸眾生不種善根，則不能發\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a26\">0335a26</span>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心。要得普門善根光\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a27\">0335a27</span>明，具真實道三昧智光，出生種種廣大福海，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a28\">0335a28</span>長白淨法無有懈息，事善知識不生疲厭，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335a29\">0335a29</span>顧身命無所藏積，等心如地無有高下，性常\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b01\">0335b01</span>慈愍一切眾生，於諸有趣專念不捨，恒樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b02\">0335b02</span>觀察如來境界；如是，乃能發菩提心。</p><p>「發菩提\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b03\">0335b03</span>心者。所謂：發大悲心，普救一切眾生故；發大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b04\">0335b04</span>慈心，等祐一切世間故；發安樂心，令一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b05\">0335b05</span>眾生滅諸苦故；發饒益心，令一切眾生離惡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b06\">0335b06</span>法故；發哀愍心，有怖畏者咸守護故；發無礙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b07\">0335b07</span>心，捨離一切諸障礙故；發廣大心，一切法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b08\">0335b08</span>界咸遍滿故；發無邊心，等虛空界無不往\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b09\">0335b09</span>故；發寬博心，悉見一切諸如來故；發清淨心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b10\">0335b10</span>於三世法智無違故；發智慧心，普入一切智\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b11\">0335b11</span>慧海故。</p><p>「善男子！我住此海門國十有二年，常\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b12\">0335b12</span>以大海為其境界。所謂：思惟大海廣大無量，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b13\">0335b13</span>思惟大海甚深難測，思惟大海漸次深廣，思\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b14\">0335b14</span>惟大海無量眾寶奇妙莊嚴，思惟大海積無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b15\">0335b15</span>量水，思惟大海水色不同不可思議，思惟大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b16\">0335b16</span>海無量眾生之所住處，思惟大海容受種種大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b17\">0335b17</span>身眾生，思惟大海能受大雲所雨之雨，思惟\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b18\">0335b18</span>大海無增無減。</p><p>「善男子！我思惟時，復作是念：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b19\">0335b19</span>『世間之中，頗有廣博過此海不？頗有無量過\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b20\">0335b20</span>此海不？頗有甚深過此海不？頗有殊特過此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b21\">0335b21</span>海不？』</p><p>「善男子！我作是念時，此海之下，有大蓮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b22\">0335b22</span>華忽然出現，以無能勝因陀羅尼羅寶為莖，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b23\">0335b23</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335003\">吠＝大【宋】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335003\">吠【大】，大【宋】【宮】</span><app n=\"0335003\"><p class=\"lg\">吠</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】\">大</rdg></app>瑠璃寶為<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335004\">藏＝華【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335004\">藏【大】，華【明】</span><app n=\"0335004\"><p class=\"lg\">藏</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">華</rdg></app>，閻浮檀金為葉，沈水為臺，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b24\">0335b24</span>碼碯為鬚，芬敷布<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335005\">濩＝護【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335005\">濩【大】，護【宮】</span><app n=\"0335005\"><p class=\"lg\">濩</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">護</rdg></app>，彌覆大海。百萬阿脩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b25\">0335b25</span>羅王執持其莖，百萬摩尼寶莊嚴網彌覆其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b26\">0335b26</span>上，百萬龍王雨以香水，百萬迦樓羅王<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335006\">銜＝<g ref=\"#CB00081\"/>【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335006\">銜【大】，<g ref=\"#CB00081\"/>【宋】</span><app n=\"0335006\"><p class=\"lg\">銜</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\"><g ref=\"#CB00081\"/></rdg></app>諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b27\">0335b27</span>瓔珞及寶繒帶周匝垂下，百萬羅剎王慈心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b28\">0335b28</span>觀察，百萬夜叉王恭敬禮拜，百萬乾闥婆王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335b29\">0335b29</span>種種音樂讚歎供養，百萬天王雨諸天華，天\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c01\">0335c01</span>鬘、天香、天燒香、天塗香、天末香、天妙衣服、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c02\">0335c02</span>天幢幡蓋，百萬梵王頭頂禮敬，百萬淨居\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c03\">0335c03</span>天合掌作禮，百萬轉輪王各以七寶莊嚴供\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c04\">0335c04</span>養，百萬海神俱時出現恭敬頂禮，百萬味光\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c05\">0335c05</span>摩尼寶光明普照，百萬淨福摩尼寶以為莊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c06\">0335c06</span>嚴，百萬普光摩尼寶為清淨藏，百萬殊勝摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c07\">0335c07</span>尼寶其光赫奕，百萬妙藏摩尼寶光照無邊，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c08\">0335c08</span>百萬閻浮幢摩尼寶次第行列，百萬金剛師\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c09\">0335c09</span>子摩尼寶不可破壞清淨莊嚴，百萬日藏摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c10\">0335c10</span>尼寶廣大清淨，百萬可樂摩尼寶具種種色，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c11\">0335c11</span>百萬如意摩尼寶莊嚴無盡光明照<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0332005\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">曜</rdg></app>。此大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c12\">0335c12</span>蓮華，如來出世善根所起，一切菩薩皆生信\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c13\">0335c13</span>樂，十方世界無不現前，從如幻法生、如夢法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c14\">0335c14</span>生、清淨業生，無諍法門之所莊嚴，入無為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c15\">0335c15</span>印，住無礙門，充滿十方一切國土，隨順諸佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c16\">0335c16</span>甚深境界，於無數百千劫歎其功德不可得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c17\">0335c17</span>盡。</p><p>「我時見彼蓮華之上，有一如來結<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335007\">跏＝加【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0335007\">跏【大】，加【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0335007\"><p class=\"lg\">跏</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">加</rdg></app>趺\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c18\">0335c18</span>坐，其身從此上至有頂。寶蓮華座不可思議，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c19\">0335c19</span>道場眾會不可思議，諸相成就不可思議，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c20\">0335c20</span>好圓滿不可思議，神通變化不可思議，色相\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c21\">0335c21</span>清淨不可思議，無見頂相不可思議，廣長舌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c22\">0335c22</span>相不可思議，善巧言說不可思議，圓滿音聲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c23\">0335c23</span>不可思議，無邊際力不可思議，清淨無畏不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c24\">0335c24</span>可思議，廣大辯才不可思議。又念彼佛往修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c25\">0335c25</span>諸行不可思議，自在成道不可思議，妙音演\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c26\">0335c26</span>法不可思議，普門示現種種莊嚴不可思議，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c27\">0335c27</span>隨其左右見各差別不可思議，一切利益皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c28\">0335c28</span>令圓滿不可思議。</p><p>「時，此如來即伸右手而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0335c29\">0335c29</span>摩我頂，為我演說普眼法門，開示一切如來\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a01\">0336a01</span>境界，顯發一切菩薩諸行，闡明一切諸佛妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a02\">0336a02</span>法，一切法輪悉入其中，能淨一切諸佛國土，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a03\">0336a03</span>能摧一切異道邪論，能滅一切諸魔軍眾，能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a04\">0336a04</span>令眾生皆生歡喜，能照一切眾生心行，能了\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a05\">0336a05</span>一切眾生諸根，隨眾生心悉令開悟。</p><p>「我從於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a06\">0336a06</span>彼如來之所聞此法門，受持讀誦，憶念觀察。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a07\">0336a07</span>假使有人，以大海量墨，須彌聚筆，書寫於此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a08\">0336a08</span>普眼法門，一品中一門，一門中一法，一法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a09\">0336a09</span>中一義，一義中一句，不得少分，何況能盡！</p><p>「善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a10\">0336a10</span>男子！我於彼佛所千二百歲，受持如是普眼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a11\">0336a11</span>法門，於日日中，以聞持陀羅尼光明，領受無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a12\">0336a12</span>數品；以寂靜門陀羅尼光明，趣入無數品；以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a13\">0336a13</span>無邊旋陀羅尼光明，普入無數品；以隨地觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a14\">0336a14</span>察陀羅尼光明，分別無數品；以威力陀羅尼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a15\">0336a15</span>光明，普攝無數品；以蓮華莊嚴陀羅尼光明，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a16\">0336a16</span>引發無數品；以清淨言音陀羅尼光明，開演\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a17\">0336a17</span>無數品；以虛空藏陀羅尼光明，顯示無數品；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a18\">0336a18</span>以光聚陀羅尼光明，增廣無數品；以海藏陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a19\">0336a19</span>羅尼光明，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336001\">辨＝辯【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336001\">辨【大】，辯【宮】</span><app n=\"0336001\"><p class=\"lg\">辨</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">辯</rdg></app>析無數品。若有眾生從十方\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a20\">0336a20</span>來，若天、若天王，若龍、若龍王，若夜叉、若夜叉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a21\">0336a21</span>王，若乾闥婆、若乾闥婆王，若阿脩羅、若阿脩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a22\">0336a22</span>羅王，若迦樓羅、若迦樓羅王，若緊那羅、若緊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a23\">0336a23</span>那羅王，若摩睺羅伽、若摩睺羅伽王，若人、若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a24\">0336a24</span>人王，若梵、若梵王，如是一切來至我所，我悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a25\">0336a25</span>為其開示解釋、稱揚讚歎，咸令愛樂、趣入、安\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a26\">0336a26</span>住此諸佛菩薩行光明普眼法門。</p><p>「善男子！我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a27\">0336a27</span>唯知此普眼法門。如諸菩薩摩訶薩深入一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a28\">0336a28</span>切菩薩行海，隨其願力而修行故；入大願海，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336a29\">0336a29</span>於無量劫住世間故；入一切眾生海，隨其心\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b01\">0336b01</span>樂廣利益故；入一切眾生心海，出生十力無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b02\">0336b02</span>礙智光故；入一切眾生根海，應<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336002\">時＝隨【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336002\">時【大】，隨【明】</span><app n=\"0336002\"><p class=\"lg\">時</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">隨</rdg></app>教化悉令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b03\">0336b03</span>調伏故；入一切剎海，成滿本願嚴淨佛剎故；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b04\">0336b04</span>入一切佛海，願常供養諸如來故；入一切法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b05\">0336b05</span>海，能以智慧咸悟入故；入一切功德海，一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b06\">0336b06</span>一修行令具足故；入一切眾生言辭海，於一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b07\">0336b07</span>切剎轉正法輪故。而我云何能知能說彼功\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b08\">0336b08</span>德行？</p><p>「善男子！從此南行六十由旬，楞伽道\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b09\">0336b09</span>邊有一聚落，名為：海岸；彼有比丘，名曰：善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b10\">0336b10</span>住。汝詣彼問：菩薩云何淨菩薩行？」</p><p>時，善財童\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b11\">0336b11</span>子禮海雲足，右遶瞻仰，辭退而去。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b12\">0336b12</span><p>爾時，善財童子專念善知識教，專念普眼法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b13\">0336b13</span>門，專念佛神力，專持法句雲，專入法海門，專\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b14\">0336b14</span>思法差別，深入法<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336003\">漩＝旋【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336003\">漩【大】，旋【宮】</span><app n=\"0336003\"><p class=\"lg\">漩</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">旋</rdg></app>澓，普入法虛空，淨<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336004\">治＝持【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336004\">治【大】，持【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0336004\"><p class=\"lg\">治</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">持</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b15\">0336b15</span>法<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336005\">翳＝瞖【宋】【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336005\">翳【大】，瞖【宋】【元】</span><app n=\"0336005\"><p class=\"lg\">翳</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】\">瞖</rdg></app>障，觀察法寶處。</p><p>漸次南行，至楞伽<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336006\">道＋（邊）【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0336006\">道【大】，道邊【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0336006\"><p class=\"lg\">道</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">道邊</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b16\">0336b16</span>海岸聚落，觀察十方，求覓善住。見此比丘於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b17\">0336b17</span>虛空中來往經行，無數諸天恭敬圍遶，散諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b18\">0336b18</span>天華，作天妓樂，幡幢繒綺悉各無數，遍滿虛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b19\">0336b19</span>空以為供養；諸大龍王，於虛空中興不思\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b20\">0336b20</span>議沈水香雲，震雷激電以為供養；緊那羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b21\">0336b21</span>王奏眾樂音，如法讚美以為供養；摩睺羅伽\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b22\">0336b22</span>王以不思議極微細衣，於虛空中周迴布設，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b23\">0336b23</span>心生歡喜，以為供養；阿脩羅王興不思議摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b24\">0336b24</span>尼寶雲，無量光明種種莊嚴，遍滿虛空以為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b25\">0336b25</span>供養；迦樓羅王作童子形，無量采女之所圍\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b26\">0336b26</span>遶，究竟成就無殺害心，於虛空中合掌供養；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b27\">0336b27</span>不思議數諸羅剎王，無量羅剎之所圍遶，其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b28\">0336b28</span>形長大，甚可怖畏，見善住比丘慈心自在，曲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336b29\">0336b29</span>躬合掌瞻仰供養；不思議數諸夜叉王，各各\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c01\">0336c01</span>悉有自眾圍遶，四面周匝恭敬守護；不思議\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c02\">0336c02</span>數諸梵天王，於虛空中曲躬合掌，以人間法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c03\">0336c03</span>稱揚讚歎；不思議數諸淨居天，於虛空中與\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c04\">0336c04</span>宮殿俱，恭敬合掌發弘誓願。</p><p>時，善財童子見\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c05\">0336c05</span>是事已，心生歡喜，合掌敬禮，作如是言：「聖\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c06\">0336c06</span>者！我已先發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心，而未\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c07\">0336c07</span>知菩薩云何修行佛法？云何積集佛法？云\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c08\">0336c08</span>何備具佛法？云何熏習佛法？云何增長佛法？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c09\">0336c09</span>云何總攝佛法？云何究竟佛法？云何淨治佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c10\">0336c10</span>法？云何深淨佛法？云何通達佛法？我聞聖\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c11\">0336c11</span>者善能誘誨，唯願慈哀，為我宣說：菩薩云何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c12\">0336c12</span>不捨見佛，常於其所精勤修習？菩薩云何不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c13\">0336c13</span>捨菩薩，與諸菩薩同一善根？菩薩云何不捨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c14\">0336c14</span>佛法，悉以智慧而得明證？菩薩云何不捨大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c15\">0336c15</span>願，能普利益一切眾生？菩薩云何不捨眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c16\">0336c16</span>行，住一切劫心無疲厭？菩薩云何不捨佛剎，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c17\">0336c17</span>普能嚴淨一切世界？菩薩云何不捨佛力，悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c18\">0336c18</span>能知見如來自在？菩薩云何不捨有為亦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c19\">0336c19</span>復不住，普於一切諸有趣中猶如變化，示\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c20\">0336c20</span>受生死，修菩薩行？菩薩云何不捨聞法，悉能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c21\">0336c21</span>領受諸佛正教？菩薩云何不捨智光，普入\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c22\">0336c22</span>三世智所行處？」</p><p>時，善住比丘告善財言：</p><p>「善哉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c23\">0336c23</span>善哉！善男子！汝已能發阿耨多羅三藐三菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c24\">0336c24</span>提心，今復發心求問佛法、一切智法、自然者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c25\">0336c25</span>法。</p><p>「善男子！我已成就菩薩無礙解脫門，若來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c26\">0336c26</span>若去，若行若止，隨順思惟，修習觀察，即時獲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c27\">0336c27</span>得智慧光明，名：究竟無礙。得此智慧光明故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c28\">0336c28</span>知一切眾生心行無所障礙，知一切眾生沒\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0336c29\">0336c29</span>生無所障礙，知一切眾生宿命無所障礙，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a01\">0337a01</span>知一切眾生未來劫事無所障礙，知一切眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a02\">0337a02</span>生現在世事無所障礙，知一切眾生言語音\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a03\">0337a03</span>聲種種差別無所障礙，決一切眾生所有疑\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a04\">0337a04</span>問無所障礙，知一切眾生諸根無所障礙，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a05\">0337a05</span>一切眾生應受化時悉能往赴無所障礙，知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a06\">0337a06</span>一切剎那、羅<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0337001\">婆＝娑【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0337001\">婆【大】，娑【宮】</span><app n=\"0337001\"><p class=\"lg\">婆</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">娑</rdg></app>、牟呼栗多、日夜時分無所障\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a07\">0337a07</span>礙，知三世海流轉次第無所障礙，能以其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a08\">0337a08</span>身遍往十方一切佛剎無所障礙。何以故？得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a09\">0337a09</span>無住無作神通力故。</p><p>「善男子！我以得此神通\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a10\">0337a10</span>力故，於虛空中或行、或住、或坐、或臥、或隱、或\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a11\">0337a11</span>顯，或現一身，或現多身，穿度牆壁猶如虛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a12\">0337a12</span>空；於虛空中結<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0337002\">跏＝加【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0337002\">跏【大】，加【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0337002\"><p class=\"lg\">跏</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">加</rdg></app>趺坐，往來自在猶如飛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a13\">0337a13</span>鳥；入地如水，履水如地，遍身上下普出煙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a14\">0337a14</span>焰如大火聚。或時震動一切大地，或時以手\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a15\">0337a15</span>摩觸日月，或現其身高至梵宮。或現燒香雲，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a16\">0337a16</span>或現寶焰雲，或現變化雲，或現光網雲，皆悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a17\">0337a17</span>廣大彌覆十方。或一念中過於東方一世界、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a18\">0337a18</span>二世界、百世界、千世界、百千世界，乃至無量\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a19\">0337a19</span>世界，乃至不可說不可說世界；或過閻浮提\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a20\">0337a20</span>微塵數世界，或過不可說不可說佛剎微塵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a21\">0337a21</span>數世界。於彼一切諸佛國土佛世尊前聽聞\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a22\">0337a22</span>說法，一一佛所現無量佛剎微塵數差別身，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a23\">0337a23</span>一一身雨無量佛剎微塵數供養雲，所謂：一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a24\">0337a24</span>切華雲、一切香雲、一切鬘雲、一切末香雲、一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a25\">0337a25</span>切塗香雲、一切蓋雲、一切衣雲、一切幢雲、一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a26\">0337a26</span>切幡雲、一切帳雲，以一切身雲而為供養。一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a27\">0337a27</span>一如來所有宣說，我皆受持；一一國土所有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a28\">0337a28</span>莊嚴，我皆憶念。如東方，南、西、北方，四維、上、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337a29\">0337a29</span>下，亦復如是。如是一切諸世界中所有眾生，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b01\">0337b01</span>若見我形，皆決定得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b02\">0337b02</span>彼諸世界一切眾生，我皆明見，隨其大小、勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b03\">0337b03</span>劣、苦樂，示同其形，教化成就。若有眾生親近\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b04\">0337b04</span>我者，悉令安住如是法門。</p><p>「善男子！我唯知此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b05\">0337b05</span>普速疾供養諸佛成就眾生無礙解脫門。如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b06\">0337b06</span>諸菩薩持大悲戒、波羅蜜戒、大乘戒、菩薩道\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b07\">0337b07</span>相應戒、無障礙戒、不退墮戒、不捨菩提心戒、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b08\">0337b08</span>常以佛法為所緣戒、於一切智常作意戒、如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b09\">0337b09</span>虛空戒、一切世間無所依戒、無失戒、無損\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b10\">0337b10</span>戒、無缺戒、無雜戒、無濁戒、無悔戒、清淨戒、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b11\">0337b11</span>離塵戒、離垢戒；如是功德，而我云何能知能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b12\">0337b12</span>說？</p><p>「善男子！從此南方有國，名：達里鼻荼，城名：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b13\">0337b13</span>自在；其中有人，名曰：彌伽。汝詣彼問：菩薩云\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b14\">0337b14</span>何學菩薩行、修菩薩道？」</p><p>時，善財童子頂禮其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b15\">0337b15</span>足，右遶瞻仰，辭退而行。</p></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0337b16\">0337b16</span><cb:juan n=\"062\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第六十二</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n</cb:div></body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}